{"id":"n26754-1-11","stage":5,"title":"위원 · 委员","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26754-1-11-1","ko":"모든 참가자들의 공연이 끝났습니다.","zh":"所有参赛者的表演都已经结束了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"모든","meaning":"全，所有","explanation":"모든：全，所有","readings":[{"term":"모든","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70813","senseId":"1","lemma":"모든","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참가자들의","meaning":"参加者，参加人","explanation":"참가자：参加者，参加人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"참가자","audio":"/audio/854fabfa8915d5054fd5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78291","senseId":"1","lemma":"참가자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공연이","meaning":"演出，表演","explanation":"공연：演出，表演；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"공연","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62459","senseId":"1","lemma":"공연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끝났습니다.","meaning":"结束，完成","explanation":"끝나다：结束，完成；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"끝나다","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34734","senseId":"1","lemma":"끝나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"f069e2cf4e340740","term":"모든","zh":"全，所有","audio":"/audio/f069e2cf4e3407407846.mp3","entryId":"70813","definition":"一个不漏或一个不剩，全部的。","pronunciation":["모ː든"]},{"id":"854fabfa8915d505","term":"참가자","zh":"参加者，参加人","audio":"/audio/854fabfa8915d5054fd5.mp3","entryId":"78291","definition":"共同参与聚会、团体、比赛或活动等的人。","pronunciation":["참가자"]},{"id":"1c3a0a24ef01c77b","term":"공연","zh":"演出，表演","audio":"/audio/1c3a0a24ef01c77b9620.mp3","entryId":"62459","definition":"将歌曲、舞蹈、戏剧等展现给观众。","pronunciation":["공연"]},{"id":"80a25f4e1416ded1","term":"끝나다","zh":"结束，完成","audio":"/audio/80a25f4e1416ded1f122.mp3","entryId":"34734","definition":"事情做完。","pronunciation":["끈나다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6a66dc0d20c3b3afb2ce.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26754-1-11-2","ko":"그러면 이제 심사 위원의 평을 들어 보기로 하겠습니다.","zh":"那么，现在我们就来听听评委们的评价吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그러면","meaning":"那么","explanation":"그러면：那么","readings":[{"term":"그러면","audio":"/audio/25763f89d255f1256055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58276","senseId":"2","lemma":"그러면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"심사","meaning":"审查","explanation":"심사：审查","readings":[{"term":"심사","audio":"/audio/e5d4b120f28c3201ea69.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16442","senseId":"1","lemma":"심사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"위원의","meaning":"委员","explanation":"위원：委员；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"위원","audio":"/audio/cf6bcf13c224b4ea0f98.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26754","senseId":"1","lemma":"위원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"평을","meaning":"评，评价，评论","explanation":"평：评，评价，评论；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"평","audio":"/audio/217dca5b5e978f0b7869.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88046","senseId":"1","lemma":"평","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어","meaning":"听","explanation":"듣다：听；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"듣다","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74104","senseId":"2","lemma":"듣다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보기로","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하겠습니다.","meaning":"决定、约定（-기로 하다）","explanation":"하다：决定、约定（-기로 하다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"25763f89d255f125","term":"그러면","zh":"那么","audio":"/audio/25763f89d255f1256055.mp3","entryId":"58276","definition":"用于表示接受前文内容，或以前文为基础，提出新的主张。","pronunciation":["그러면"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"e5d4b120f28c3201","term":"심사","zh":"审查","audio":"/audio/e5d4b120f28c3201ea69.mp3","entryId":"16442","definition":"为了分辨好坏而仔细察看。","pronunciation":["심사"]},{"id":"cf6bcf13c224b4ea","term":"위원","zh":"委员","audio":"/audio/cf6bcf13c224b4ea0f98.mp3","entryId":"26754","definition":"通过选举或任命在团体中负责特定事情的人。","pronunciation":["위원"]},{"id":"217dca5b5e978f0b","term":"평","zh":"评，评价，评论","audio":"/audio/217dca5b5e978f0b7869.mp3","entryId":"88046","definition":"评判好坏、优劣、对错等；或指那样的话。","pronunciation":["평ː"]},{"id":"58977b8705722edc","term":"듣다","zh":"听","audio":"/audio/58977b8705722edc164c.mp3","entryId":"74104","definition":"聆听他人的话或声音等。","pronunciation":["듣따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"决定、约定（-기로 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"决定、约定（-기로 하다）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c554a31273060714ff01.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.498,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26754","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":168,"sequenceScore":3.3247,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["所有参赛者的表演都已经结束了。","那么，现在我们就来听听评委们的评价吧。","这个结有点松，好像以后会散开的。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["所有参赛者的表演都已经结束了。","那么，现在我们就来听听评委们的评价吧。","这个结有点松，好像以后会散开的。"],"answer":1}]}
